{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：15:24 2026-11-18 HKT</p>\n<p>東區走廊發生車禍。今日（18日）下午1時23分，一輛電單車由柴灣沿東廊往銅鑼灣方向行駛，當駛至筲箕灣支路近愛東邨對開的分叉路口時，失事翻車並撞向分隔馬路的防撞欄。電單車一分為二斷開兩截，幸電單車男司機奇蹟輕傷，只是右腳受傷。他事後自行報警並由救護車送往東區醫院治理。</p>\n<img alt=\"電單車斷開兩截。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/e6f7658ca6250bb1c58fe57c88039b33/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_14_46_36_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員在場處理，地面上木糠。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/2aeb62e9dcfeb59923ebda07474153b2/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_14_46_35_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/45adbaeaad2d7f6c68aa6a35fd3ea6bb/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_14_46_36.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"電單車盡毀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/25f6f9b14e2c434d65f6c74a99379041/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_14_46_35.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/5bcaf76e45c35009c4c450de143941b8/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_14_46_23.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/b3f2dbfd113a83923874611151d0752d/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_14_46_22_4_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/4e098636a05e69cc5e390906c49043c8/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_14_46_22_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"事後拖車將電單車拖走。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/078294f0c46dde6aec673610f1968206/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_14_46_22_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/2a364cfbf601f1e5e1edda4317e9ce15/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_14_46_22.jpeg\"/>\n<p>現場所見，電單車一分為二，橫亙在馬路上，碎片散落一地，防撞欄亦損毀。電單車男司機身穿的牛仔褲右褲管破開，他站在防撞欄旁邊待救，事後獲送院。警方正調查意外原因。</p>\n<img alt=\"電單車男司機輕傷，事後在路邊待救。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a8c78030810a67a8519d5e18c4c945df/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_14_52_45_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鐵騎士奇蹟輕傷，牛仔褲右褲管破開。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d28b1a17410ab4602c8de55656ac34f1/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_14_52_44.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/433a818ec8f27075f8b4e94acaf2f472/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_14_46_21_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警方調查意外原因。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/5a97bb809c20329da7647c9a060c7e63/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_14_46_21.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/8ffb4fbb70ad8e8d29aead5aa30d61ff/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_14_46_20_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/4e4b05900f4abf046eefed2417dc977b/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_14_46_20.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/18ac3c0e630c945ad8add622502c75eb/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_14_46_19.jpeg\"/>\n<p>根據網上車CAM片段所見，當時電單車高速在東廊飛馳，至一彎位時失事撞向分隔馬路的防撞欄，鐵騎士竟被拋飛逾100米外的位置，之後若無其事返回電單車旁檢查。</p>\n<img alt=\"電單車高速在東廊飛馳。網上片段截圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a883065075948034b70fe658539e6157/2026-11/1880509560051497_HD_mp4_snapshot_00_08_175.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"電單車駛至一彎位時失事撞向分隔馬路的防撞欄。網上片段截圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/16a1a4ab288d37586033b76bfde9906a/2026-11/1880509560051497_HD_mp4_snapshot_00_18_498.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"電單車駛至一彎位時失事撞向分隔馬路的防撞欄。網上片段截圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/f72d63cfeb48950877b1e5aaf942331f/2026-11/1880509560051497_HD_mp4_snapshot_00_24_420.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鐵騎士竟被拋飛逾100米外的位置，之後若無其事返回電單車旁檢查。網上片段截圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/062f467b3be193b59bcc06e23133ef3e/2026-11/1880509560051497_HD_mp4_snapshot_00_34_587.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鐵騎士竟被拋飛逾100米外的位置，之後若無其事返回電單車旁檢查。網上片段截圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/0b90abba2f773405d7bee724f17c2f40/2026-11/1880509560051497_HD_mp4_snapshot_00_41_661.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鐵騎士竟被拋飛逾100米外的位置，之後若無其事返回電單車旁檢查。網上片段截圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/f90230ea05e677e8cbb66bcc415435c8/2026-11/1880509560051497_HD_mp4_snapshot_00_46_587.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T08:03:57.217061+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":316,"images":22,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T07:48:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T11:57:35.496063+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T07:57:27.249571+00:00","content_hash":"ed5ae219bd7ed26de02b7620eb9036b5d5b73fc741c44d5b7e7d857d92755287","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}